  "universal": {
    "_doc": [
      "对所有会话生效的结构红线（enforce-scope.mjs universal 段）。",
      "denyCreate：禁影子 contracts 目录——真契约面在 docs/contracts/**，根级 contracts/** 一律视为影子。文档骨架白名单见 docsTopLevel。",
      "denyCreate 条目 delivery/changes/** = 废止位（261015-gov-review-changes-taxonomy：dev lane 已由 261014 批撤销〔T1 齿一，波段一先落 dev 子路径〕、伞已随 T6 解散归档 delivery/archive/changes/）——任何写入即违规，真家见 delivery/archive/README.md 旧→新映射（review = delivery/review/、intake = delivery/intake/、retro = delivery/retro/、dev = delivery/taskpackages/）。"
    ],
    "denyCreate": [
      "contracts/**",
      "delivery/changes/**"
    ],
    "bashDenyWrite": [
      "docs/contracts/**",
      ".claude/**",
      "delivery/taskpackages/**"
    ],
    "_bashDenyWrite_doc": "Bash 重定向写契约面与强制层 = 硬红线。原 .claude/** 红线对验收包的覆盖随 taskpackages 迁出（260914-gov-review-delivery-restructure T2）平移为 delivery/taskpackages/**。审查者提示句会提及 delivery/taskpackages/ 等目录——无害，留作档 2 升级时自然启用。",
